Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in shared HIDL1 raw recording with durable storage

Arbitrate recorder and UI demands in the existing HIDL1 connection. Preserve raw
HAL events before conversion, batch persistence outside callbacks, report loss,
and hold a distinct wake lock until accepted data is durable. The private control
socket is created only when HOKI_RECORDING_SOCKET is configured. Capture
session IDs protect modern mutating requests from stale cleanup clients. HIDL2 recording
is not implemented. No recorder service is enabled by this patch.

Upstream-Status: Pending

